   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 22,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 2 - H3 reference to video + multi-frame guides\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: reference pictures (<Picture 1>, <Picture 2> ...) named in the prompt; guide images anchored at chosen frames (Add Guide; a negative frame_idx counts from the end; a 5+ frame clip anchors a clip).\n\n**Controls**: chain more Add Guide nodes for more anchors; H3 Geometry Report lists every reference / guide with its token grid and flags guides off the output grid.\n\n**Output**: an MP4 with picture and sound.\n\n**Limits**: guides are cover-cropped to the canvas; references sit on their own grid (placement is guided, not forced - see docs/h3_mask_control_matrix.md).\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# 2 - H3 reference to video + multi-frame guides\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: reference pictures (<Picture 1>, <Picture 2> ...) named in the prompt; guide images anchored at chosen frames (Add Guide; a negative frame_idx counts from the end; a 5+ frame clip anchors a clip).\n\n**Controls**: chain more Add Guide nodes for more anchors; H3 Geometry Report lists every reference / guide with its token grid and flags guides off the output grid.\n\n**Output**: an MP4 with picture and sound.\n\n**Limits**: guides are cover-cropped to the canvas; references sit on their own grid (placement is guided, not forced - see docs/h3_mask_control_matrix.md).\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
